        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d123-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d123-f1-content">
                <p>Source: National Archives, RG 59, Transcripts of
                    Secretary of State Henry Kissinger’s
                    Staff Meetings, 1973–1977, Entry 5177, Box 5, Secretary’s Staff Meetings.
                    Secret.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d123-f2" n="2" xml:id="d123-f2-content">
                <p>Secretary of State Kissinger, Assistant
                    Secretary of State for African Affairs Easum, and Director of the Bureau of Intelligence and Research
                        Hyland briefly reviewed the current
                    situation in Ethiopia and the implications of military assistance.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
